WEBVTT

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.800
"Aku sudah menjadi banyak hal

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.560
sepanjang perjalanan hidupku:

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.240
bocah miskin, orang negro,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.070
orang Yale, orang Harvard,

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.855
orang banci, orang Kristen,

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.840
bayi pemadat, diduga,

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:49.830
anak setan, Kedatangan Kedua,

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.694
Casey."

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.290
Itu baru halaman enam.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.205
(Tertawa)

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.080
Jadi Anda bisa paham
kekhawatiran ibu saya.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.617
Tapi beliau hanya ingin
mengubah satu hal kecil.